efore The Drop","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"投資者在 Lululemon Athletica 下跌之前犯了哪些錯誤"},{"title":"LULU UPCOMING DEADLINE: Levi & Korsinsky Alerts Lululemon Athletica Inc. Stockholders of Securities Class Action - Contact the Firm","src":"PR Newswire","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"LULU 即將到來的截止日期：Levi & Korsinsky 提醒 Lululemon Athletica Inc. 股東進行證券集體訴訟 - 聯絡該公司"},{"title":"Will Revenue Outlook Cut Change Lululemon Stock's Narrative","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"收入前景的下調會改變 Lululemon 股票的敘述嗎"},{"title":"Lululemon Stock Crashed 17% on Friday. The Guidance Cut Was the Real Story.","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPLTEtWGg3dWFCRldFYUV5QXVIeW1zZTlMaEFMVlZ0NnVxN2VuVHhaUy1uZ2k0bTR3X2YzUXE1S0p6bnZDb1pXZWxZb1JRSWRsRTh5NXJIaDlsc1k3QUxzczk0WUhOeThMWkJjQ0pLRFl1bEhSOFpod0hYUnV3VVJUUVdWeU5ldWpZVS1UQ0pBWXpPMXJmQzJXdU9sbFJBS28?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"Lululemon 股價週五暴跌 17%。指導性削減是真實的故事。"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-17","period":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1397187/000139718726000020/lulu-20260201.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"lululemon athletica inc. is principally a designer, distributor, and retailer of technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories. Our vision is to create transformative products and experiences that build meaningful connections, unlocking greater possibility and wellbeing for all. Since our inception, we have fostered a distinctive corporate culture; we promote a set of core values in our business which include taking personal responsibility, acting with courage, valuing connection and inclusion, and choosing to have fun. These core values attract passionate and motivated employees who are driven to achieve personal and professional goals, and share our purpose \"to elevate human potential by helping people feel their best.\"","zh":"露露檸檬運動公司主要是一家技術運動服裝、鞋類和配件的設計商、經銷商和零售商。我們的願景是創造變革性的產品和體驗，建立有意義的聯繫，為所有人釋放更大的可能性和福祉。自成立以來，我們培養了獨特的企業文化；我們在業務中提倡一套核心價值觀，包括承擔個人責任、勇敢行動、重視聯繫和包容以及選擇享受樂趣。這些核心價值吸引了充滿熱情和積極進取的員工，他們致力於實現個人和職業目標，並與我們一樣「透過幫助人們感受最好的狀態來提升人類潛力」。"},{"en":"In this Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended February 1, 2026, lululemon athletica inc. (together with its subsidiaries) is referred to as \"lululemon,\" \"the Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our.\" We refer to the fiscal year ended February 1, 2026 as \"2025,\" the fiscal year ended February 2, 2025 as \"2024.\" Our next fiscal year ends on January 31, 2027 and is referred to as \"2026.\"","zh":"在這份截至 2026 年 2 月 1 日的財政年度 10-K 表格年度報告中，lululemon Att. （及其子公司）被稱為「lululemon」、「公司」、「我們」或「我們的」。我們將截至 2026 年 2 月 1 日的財政年度稱為“2025”，截至 2025 年 2 月 2 日的財政年度稱為“2024”。我們的下一個財政年度將於 2027 年 1 月 31 日結束，稱為「2026 年」。"},{"en":"We offer a comprehensive line of technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories marketed under the lululemon brand. Our apparel assortment includes:","zh":"我們提供全系列的技術運動服裝、鞋類和配件，以 lululemon 品牌銷售。我們的服裝品種包括："}],"markets":[{"en":"We offer a comprehensive line of technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories marketed under the lululemon brand. Our apparel assortment includes:","zh":"我們提供全系列的技術運動服裝、鞋類和配件，以 lululemon 品牌銷售。我們的服裝品種包括："},{"en":"Pants, shorts, tops, and jackets designed for a healthy lifestyle including athletic activities such as yoga, running, training, and most other activities;","zh":"專為健康生活方式而設計的褲子、短褲、上衣和夾克，包括瑜伽、跑步、訓練和大多數其他活動等體育活動；"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We offer a comprehensive line of technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories marketed under the lululemon brand. Our apparel assortment includes:","zh":"我們提供全系列的技術運動服裝、鞋類和配件，以 lululemon 品牌銷售。我們的服裝品種包括："},{"en":"Pants, shorts, tops, and jackets designed for a healthy lifestyle including athletic activities such as yoga, running, training, and most other activities;","zh":"專為健康生活方式而設計的褲子、短褲、上衣和夾克，包括瑜伽、跑步、訓